<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SOTAlign: Semi-Supervised Alignment of Unimodal 
<br class="ltx_break">Vision and Language Models via Optimal Transport</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
