<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="A2.T11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Alignment per dataset. Following the setup of SUE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib57" title="" class="ltx_ref">Yacobi et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, we train for alignment per dataset and evaluate image-text retrieval (Recall@5). We report SOTAlign results adhering to the architectural choices of SUE (MLP, embedding dimensionality of 8) and without these constraints.</span></figcaption>
